{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（14日）下午1時許，警方接報指葵涌國瑞路168號一個私人屋苑有人懷疑從高處墮下。</p><p>30餘歲男事主送往仁濟醫院搶救，其後證實不治。</p><p>警方正調查事件原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.377272+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:13:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:38.333073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"ffcf3908e941f7ba5dbcbeaac0ec736433e029c72f32600438d1f7255a1703ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}